#. translators: %1$s: segment label, %2$s: metric label, %3$s: segment value,
#. %4$s: value for everyone else, %5$s: segment sessions, %6$s: total
#. sessions.
#: opti-behavior/includes/trait-opti-behavior-assets.php:842
